      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Congrats :)\n\nAnd if you made it this far, you probably patted a lot
    of cacti or smoked a lot of cigarettes. You saw that charging directly towards
    the target is not always the best option and remembered to take a break, rest
    for a while and do something else, no matter the pressure. You realised that
    forcing yourself into doing the same thing over and over again without any stops
    can be extremely hard. And even eventually turn out unoptimal. \n\nNow just remember
    that and may it guide you in your every day life :)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5788301e62e31384eb3959630ae5c806, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9054796549509301454, guid: 5788301e62e31384eb3959630ae5c806, type: 2}
